msgid "TOME_IVORY@TOME@NAME"
msgstr "Tome of Ivory Towers"

msgid "TOME_IVORY@TOME@LORE_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"“Life is precious. It is for this reason that we few harbour the shadowed "
"hearts that bring enlightened bliss to all minds. Order must be brought in "
"our own hearth first, before the World can enjoy our starlit harmony.”"

msgid "TOME_IVORY@TOME@LORE_AUTHOR"
msgstr "Dragomir, Kindred of the Night"

msgid "TOME_IVORY@TOME@GAMEPLAY_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Focus on bolstering your ally's resolve, by any means necessary. Bolster "
"your heroes on the battlefield, and lead your armies to victory."

msgid "TOME_IVORY@SKILL_1@NAME"
msgstr "The Ivory Towers"

msgid "TOME_IVORY@SKILL_1@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"[bulletlist][bullet/]+10 {GLOBAL.FortificationHealthConcept.Hyperlink}. "
"[bullet/]+10 {GLOBAL.KnowledgeConcept.Hyperlink}. [bullet/]Allied units in "
"domain start battles with +5 {GLOBAL.UnitMoraleConcept.Hyperlink}.[/"
"bulletlist] \n"
"[/br]For each {GLOBAL.CityStabilityConcept.Hyperlink} level above {GLOBAL."
"CityStabilityUnstable.Hyperlink} the city gains: [bulletlist][bullet/]+5 "
"{GLOBAL.ManaConcept.Hyperlink}. [bullet/]+5 {GLOBAL.KnowledgeConcept."
"Hyperlink}."

msgid "TOME_IVORY@SKILL_2@NAME"
msgstr "Mind-Blanked Bliss"

msgid "TOME_IVORY@SKILL_2@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Target owned Throne City produces:[bulletlist][bullet/]+4 {GLOBAL."
"ImperiumConcept.Hyperlink} for each {GLOBAL.CityStabilityConcept.Hyperlink} "
"above neutral. [bullet/]-10 {GLOBAL.StructureProductionConcept.Hyperlink}."

msgid "TOME_IVORY@SKILL_3@NAME"
msgstr "Thrall of the Pale Divine"

msgid "TOME_IVORY@SKILL_3@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"At the start of your turn, if the unit has {GLOBAL.HighMoraleConcept."
"Hyperlink}, for 1 {GLOBAL.TurnConcept.Hyperlink}, gain:[bulletlist]"
"[bullet/]+1 {GLOBAL.DefenseConcept.Hyperlink}[bullet/]+1 {GLOBAL."
"ResistanceConcept.Hyperlink}[bullet/]+5 <<m:{GLOBAL.TemporaryHitPointConcept."
"Hyperlink}>>"

msgid "TOME_IVORY@SKILL_4@NAME"
msgstr "Shimmer of Power"

msgid "TOME_IVORY@SKILL_4@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Friendly units in a 1-hex radius gains:[bulletlist][bullet/]Undergo {GLOBAL."
"PROPERTIES.WIGHTBORN_PROPERTY_GROUP.Hyperlink} and {GLOBAL.AngelizeConcept."
"Hyperlink} until end of battle but are {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.VEC_LESSER_CONCEPT."
"Hyperlink} if turned this way.[bullet/]Remove all negative status "
"effects[bullet/]2x {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.REGENERATION.Hyperlink}[bullet/]"
"{GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.STEADFAST.Hyperlink}[bullet/]3x {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES."
"STRENGTHENED.Hyperlink}[bullet/]The weaknesses of {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES."
"CELESTIAL.Hyperlink} and {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.UNDEAD.Hyperlink} are "
"removed[bullet/]If already Celestial or Undead, all your Celestial and "
"Undead weaknesses become resistances instead."

msgid "TOME_IVORY@SKILL_5@NAME"
msgstr "Ivory Noble"

msgid "TOME_IVORY@SKILL_5@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"A High Noble who excels in Spiritual Magic. Their very presence invokes "
"reverence."

msgid "TOME_IVORY@SKILL_6@NAME"
msgstr "Pavane of the Silver Prince"

msgid "TOME_IVORY@SKILL_6@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Units in 1 hex radius sustain:[bulletlist][bullet/]20 {GLOBAL."
"PhysicalDamageConcept.Hyperlink}.[bullet/]Suffer the {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES."
"DISTRACTED.Hyperlink} status condition."

msgid "TOME_IVORY@HERO_SKILL@NAME"
msgstr "Inspiring Killer"

msgid "TOME_IVORY@HERO_SKILL@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "Grants the unit {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.INSPIRING_KILLER.Hyperlink}."

msgid "TOME_IVORY@PROVINCE_IMPROVEMENT1@NAME"
msgstr "[Mine/] Ghost Marble Mine"

msgid "TOME_IVORY@PROVINCE_IMPROVEMENT1@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"[bulletlist][bullet/]+10 {GLOBAL.GoldConcept.Hyperlink}[bullet/]+3 {GLOBAL."
"SoulConcept.Hyperlink} for each adjacent {GLOBAL.MineConcept.Hyperlink}."
"[bullet/]+3 {GLOBAL.GoldConcept.Hyperlink} for each adjacent {GLOBAL."
"MineConcept.Hyperlink}. [bullet/]Counts as a {GLOBAL.MineConcept.Hyperlink}."

msgid "TOME_IVORY@UNIT1@ABILITY1@NAME"
msgstr "Chilling Geas"

msgid "TOME_IVORY@UNIT1@ABILITY1@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Target enemy unit:[bulletlist] [bullet/]Is {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.TAUNTED."
"Hyperlink}.[bullet/]Suffers 2 {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.WEAKENED.Hyperlink}. [/"
"bulletlist]\n"
"Caster gains 2 {GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.STRENGTHENED.Hyperlink}."

msgid "TOME_IVORY@UNIT1@ABILITY2@NAME"
msgstr "Lessers"

msgid "TOME_IVORY@UNIT1@ABILITY2@DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"They do not count as the unit type the transformation grants for the purpose "
"of external spells and effects, unless they were of that unit type "
"beforehand. Additionally, the gained unit type ceases should the unit fall "
"(even if resurrected).\n"
"Modder's Note: This is a coding limitation"

