msgid "TOME_IVORY@NOBLE@GIFT@NAME"
msgstr "Ivoric Gift"

msgid "TOME_IVORY@NOBLE@GIFT@DESC"
msgstr ""
"Target friendly unit:[bulletlist][bullet/]Remove all positive effects on "
"self.[bullet/]Grant 1 random positive effect on target friendly unit for "
"each stack removed (that lasts 1 turn less)[bullet/]Heal the target by 10 "
"{GLOBAL.TemporaryHitPointConcept.Hyperlink} + 1 for each positive effect "
"granted."

msgid "TOME_IVORY@NOBLE@EXTRACT@NAME"
msgstr "Ivoric Extract"

msgid "TOME_IVORY@NOBLE@EXTRACT@DESC"
msgstr ""
"Inflict damage to an enemy unit:[bulletlist][bullet/]Steal all positive "
"effects from enemy unit (reset timer but is 1 turn less)[bullet/]Gain "
"{GLOBAL.TemporaryHitPointConcept.Hyperlink} equal to the damage dealt."

msgid "TOME_IVORY@NOBLE@THRALLS@NAME"
msgstr "Calling of the Thralls"

msgid "TOME_IVORY@NOBLE@THRALLS@DESC"
msgstr ""
"For 2 <<m:{GLOBAL.TurnConcept.Hyperlink}>>, gain one of the following "
"abilities:[bulletlist][bullet/]{GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.ARCHONS_SMITE.Hyperlink}"
"[bullet/]{GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.WAIL_OF_THE_BANSHEE.Hyperlink}[bullet/]{GLOBAL."
"PROPERTIES.PHASE.Hyperlink}[bullet/]{GLOBAL.PROPERTIES.INSPIRING_KILLER."
"Hyperlink}[/bulletlist]\n"
"(Will NOT grant an ability this unit already has)"

msgid "TOME_IVORY@NOBLE@LORE@NAME"
msgstr "Lore - Ivory Noble"

msgid "TOME_IVORY@NOBLE@LORE@DESC"
msgstr ""
"Spiritual scientists that studies the relationship of Necrotic and Celestial "
"Magic. Their spectacular breakthroughs earned them the title of Nobles. They "
"are highly revered individuals for their knowledge of the spirits. \n"
"\n"
"They are referred to as \"Ivory Nobles\" as they are so focused in their "
"studies, they seclude themselves from the outside, but they come out when "
"needed and each time they do, people look in awe, inspiring them to do great "
"things too."
